    <briefdescription>
<para>Demonstrates <ref refid="struct_x_uart_ns550" kindref="compound">XUartNs550</ref> driver usage in polled mode. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains a design example using the Uart 16450/550 driver (<ref refid="struct_x_uart_ns550" kindref="compound">XUartNs550</ref>) and hardware device using polled mode.</para><para>MODIFICATION HISTORY: <preformatted>
